<title>AUSTRIA: Austria EVN 1995/6 EPS rises to 108 ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria EVN 1995/6 EPS rises to 108 ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to August 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in schillings)</p>
<p>							1995/6	1994/5</p>
<p>    OeVFA earnings/share			 108  vs	87</p>
<p>    OeVFA cash earnings/share		  276  vs     261</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Energieversorgung Niederoesterreich AG, a regional utility. Figures were calculated by the Austrian Society of Financial Analysts and Investment Advisors (OeVFA) after meeting company management. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
